WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:09.378
"I see Rusty Moon," Ringo said.

2
00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:18.976
He flew toward the small moon.

3
00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:22.480
"Be careful," Lucy said.

4
00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:26.319
"Bot usually flies the spaceship for you."

5
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.055
Ringo laughed. "Don't worry!

6
00:00:30.056 --> 00:00:31.650
I'm a great pilot.

7
00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:32.775
I know how to—"

8
00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:35.478
"Look out!" Lucy said.

9
00:00:35.479 --> 00:00:37.536
Ringo hit a tower.

10
00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.850
The spaceship spun around and crashed.

11
00:00:40.851 --> 00:00:50.984
Bam!

12
00:00:50.985 --> 00:00:55.187
"Lucy, are you okay?" Ringo asked.

13
00:00:55.188 --> 00:00:58.097
"I'm fine," Lucy said.

14
00:00:58.098 --> 00:01:01.349
"Is the spaceship okay?"

15
00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:04.177
Ringo pressed the button.

16
00:01:04.178 --> 00:01:06.917
The spaceship didn't start.

17
00:01:06.918 --> 00:01:09.758
"Uh-oh," he said.

18
00:01:09.759 --> 00:01:15.277
Lucy groaned.

19
00:01:15.278 --> 00:01:23.566
They went outside and checked the spaceship.

20
00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:26.324
There were big scratches.

21
00:01:26.325 --> 00:01:32.201
The engine was dented.

22
00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:41.974
Ringo and Lucy found the repair shop.

23
00:01:41.975 --> 00:01:44.893
"How can I help you?" the worker asked.

24
00:01:44.894 --> 00:01:50.881
"I need to buy a new hex link," Ringo said.

25
00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:58.527
The worker quickly found a hex link.

26
00:01:58.528 --> 00:02:01.992
"Thanks!" Ringo said.

27
00:02:01.993 --> 00:02:05.121
"One more thing," Lucy said.

28
00:02:05.122 --> 00:02:09.508
"Can you fix our spaceship quickly?"

29
00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:14.348
Ringo and Lucy showed him the spaceship.

30
00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:19.933
The worker checked it out.

31
00:02:19.934 --> 00:02:22.734
"I can fix it," he said.

32
00:02:22.735 --> 00:02:27.921
"But it will take a week."

